 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Amazon Data Lifecycle Manager API (2018-01-12). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Custom lifecycle policies are stored metadata: their schedules never run, so no EBS snapshot, EBS-backed AMI or cross-Region or cross-account copy is created, retained or deleted, and the execution role is not assumed. Default policies (DefaultPolicy and its CreateInterval, RetainInterval, CopyTags, ExtendDeletion, CrossRegionCopyTargets and Exclusions request members) are refused; PolicyDetails is required. GetLifecyclePolicies filters by PolicyIds and State only; the policy type is not repeated in list summaries.",
  "title": "Amazon Data Lifecycle Manager (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "2018-01-12"
 },
